{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-b46a8819-58a8-4bf3-a127-ffc6196df16e-13","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"1→# `(无名包).snd_hurt1` — 受击语音 Sound\n\n一句话目的：受击语音 `Sound` 导出。`MainTimeline` `defineHurtSound` / `defineHurtFlySound` / `defineDieSound` 把本 Class 交给 `FighterVoiceCtrler.setVoice`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/sasuke/scripts/snd_hurt1.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FighterCtrler.defineHurtSound`](../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterCtrler.md) 把 rest Class 存进 voice 0；Fly=1、Die=2。McCtrler 受击时按类型随机播。本文件 `sasuke/snd_hurt1`。\n10→\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **Embed** `source=\"/_assets/1_snd_hurt1.mp3\"`。\n- **类** `public dynamic class snd_hurt1 extends Sound`。\n- **构造** 空 `super()`。无循环、无音量。\n"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"1→# `(无名包).snd_hurt1` — 受击语音 Sound\n\n一句话目的：受击语音 `Sound` 导出。`MainTimeline` `defineHurtSound` / `defineHurtFlySound` / `defineDieSound` 把本 Class 交给 `FighterVoiceCtrler.setVoice`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/sasuke/scripts/snd_hurt1.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FighterCtrler.defineHurtSound`](../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterCtrler.md) 把 rest Class 存进 voice 0；Fly=1、Die=2。McCtrler 受击时按类型随机播。本文件 `sasuke/snd_hurt1`。\n10→\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **Embed** `source=\"/_assets/1_snd_hurt1.mp3\"`。\n- **类** `public dynamic class snd_hurt1 extends Sound`。\n- **构造** 空 `super()`。无循环、无音量。\n","content_concise":"1→# `(无名包).snd_hurt1` — 受击语音 Sound\n\n一句话目的：受击语音 `Sound` 导出。`MainTimeline` `defineHurtSound` / `defineHurtFlySound` / `defineDieSound` 把本 Class 交给 `FighterVoiceCtrler.setVoice`。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/sasuke/scripts/snd_hurt1.as`（15 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n[`FighterCtrler.defineHurtSound`](../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/ctrler/FighterCtrler.md) 把 rest Class 存进 voice 0；Fly=1、Die=2。McCtrler 受击时按类型随机播。本文件 `sasuke/snd_hurt1`。\n10→\n## 逐行说明\n\n- **Embed** `source=\"/_assets/1_snd_hurt1.mp3\"`。\n- **类** `public dynamic class snd_hurt1 extends Sound`。\n- **构造** 空 `super()`。无循