{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-eef44b8e-9b2b-49a8-9b5c-77d81c785797-26","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract defineAction tables from fighter MainTimeline.as into markdown.\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport re\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n10→ROOT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3\")\nFIGHTERS = ROOT / \"decompiled/fighters\"\nOUT = ROOT / \"reverse/05-fighter-actions.md\"\n\nDEFINE_RE = re.compile(\n    r'defineAction\\(\\s*\"([^\"]+)\"\\s*,\\s*\\{([^}]*)\\}',\n    re.S,\n)\nFRAME_RE = re.compile(r\"internal function (frame\\d+)\\s*\\(\")\nFIELD_RE = re.compile(r'\"(\\w+)\"\\s*:\\s*([^,\\n]+)')\n20→\n\ndef parse_fields(body: str) -> dict[str, str]:\n    out: dict[str, str] = {}\n    for k, v in FIELD_RE.findall(body):\n        out[k] = v.strip()\n    return out\n\n\ndef parse_timeline(path: Path) -> list[dict]:\n30→    text = path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n    frames: list[tuple[int, str]] = [(m.start(), m.group(1)) for m in FRAME_RE.finditer(text)]\n    frames.append((len(text), \"_end\"))\n\n    def frame_at(pos: int) -> str:\n        cur = \"file\"\n        for start, name in frames:\n            if start <= pos:\n                cur = name\n            else:\n40→                break\n        return cur\n\n    rows = []\n    for m in DEFINE_RE.finditer(text):\n        fields = parse_fields(m.group(2))\n        rows.append(\n            {\n                \"id\": m.group(1),\n                \"power\": fields.get(\"power\", \"\"),\n50→                \"hitType\": fields.get(\"hitType\", \"\"),\n                \"hitx\": fields.get(\"hitx\", \"\"),\n                \"hity\": fields.get(\"hity\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtTime\": fields.get(\"hurtTime\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtType\": fields.get(\"hurtType\", \"\"),\n                \"isBreakDef\": fields.get(\"isBreakDef\", \"\"),\n                \"frame\": frame_at(m.start()),\n            }\n        )\n    return rows\n60→\n\ndef load_xml_fighters() -> tuple[list[dict], list[dict]]:\n    playable = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n70→        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        sf = file_el.get(\"startFrame\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        playable.append(\n            {\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url, \"startFrame\": sf}\n        )\n\n    assists = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/assist.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n80→        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        assists.append({\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url})\n    return playable, assists\n\n\ndef url_to_folder(url: str, assist: bool = False) -> str | None:\n    if not url:\n90→        return None\n    # assets/fighter/ichigo.swf -> ichigo\n    # assets/fighter/fz/kon.swf -> fz/kon\n    p = url.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\")\n    if p.startswith(\"assets/fighter/\"):\n        p = p[len(\"assets/fighter/\") :]\n    if p.endswith(\".swf\"):\n        p = p[: -len(\".swf\")]\n    return p\n\n100→\ndef md_escape(s: str) -> str:\n    return s.replace(\"|\", \"\\\\|\")\n\n\ndef write_move_table(lines: list[str], rows: list[dict], by_frame: bool) -> None:\n    if not rows:\n        lines.append(\"_no defineAction found_\")\n        lines.append(\"\")\n        return\n110→    grouped: dict[str, list[dict]] = defaultdict(list)\n    for r in rows:\n        grouped[r[\"frame\"]].append(r)\n    order = list(dict.fromkeys(r[\"frame\"] for r in rows))\n    for fr in order:\n        chunk = grouped[fr]\n        if by_frame:\n            lines.append(f\"**{fr}** ({len(chunk)} moves)\")\n        lines.append(\"| id | power | hitType | hitx | hity | hurtTime | hurtType | isBreakDef |\")\n        lines.append(\"|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\")\n120→        for r in chunk:\n            lines.append(\n                \"| {id} | {power} | {hitType} | {hitx} | {hity} | {hurtTime} | {hurtType} | {isBreakDef} |\".format(\n                    **{k: md_escape(str(r[k])) for k in (\n                        \"id\", \"power\", \"hitType\", \"hitx\", \"hity\", \"hurtTime\", \"hurtType\", \"isBreakDef\"\n                    )}\n                )\n            )\n        lines.append(\"\")\n\n130→\ndef main() -> None:\n    playable_xml, assist_xml = load_xml_fighters()\n\n    timelines = sorted(FIGHTERS.rglob(\"MainTimeline.as\"))\n    by_folder: dict[str, Path] = {}\n    for p in timelines:\n        rel = p.relative_to(FIGHTERS).as_posix()\n        # ichigo/scripts/ichigo_fla/MainTimeline.as -> ichigo\n        folder = rel.split(\"/scripts/\")[0]\n140→        by_folder[folder] = p\n\n    lines: list[str] = []\n    lines.append(\"# 05 角色招式全表\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"从 `decompiled/fighters/**/MainTimeline.as` 抽出全部 `defineAction(id, {…})`。\")\n    lines.append(\"对照 `extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml` 与 `assist.xml`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"引擎：`FighterMain.initlize()` 执行 `_mainMc.gotoAndStop(data.startFrame + 1)`，\")\n    lines.append(\"因此 XML `startFrame=N` 对应时间轴 `frame{N+1}`。\")\n150→    lines.append(\"VO 字段：`power` / `hitType` / `hitx` / `hity` / `hurtTime` / `hurtType` / `isBreakDef`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n\n    # directory table\n    lines.append(\"## 目录\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"| 目录 | 类型 | XML id | 名称 | startFrame | 招式数 |\")\n    lines.append(\"|---|---|---|---|---|---:|\")\n\n    parsed: dict[str, list[dict]] = {}\n160→    for folder, path in sorted(by_folder.items()):"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract defineAction tables from fighter MainTimeline.as into markdown.\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport re\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n10→ROOT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3\")\nFIGHTERS = ROOT / \"decompiled/fighters\"\nOUT = ROOT / \"reverse/05-fighter-actions.md\"\n\nDEFINE_RE = re.compile(\n    r'defineAction\\(\\s*\"([^\"]+)\"\\s*,\\s*\\{([^}]*)\\}',\n    re.S,\n)\nFRAME_RE = re.compile(r\"internal function (frame\\d+)\\s*\\(\")\nFIELD_RE = re.compile(r'\"(\\w+)\"\\s*:\\s*([^,\\n]+)')\n20→\n\ndef parse_fields(body: str) -> dict[str, str]:\n    out: dict[str, str] = {}\n    for k, v in FIELD_RE.findall(body):\n        out[k] = v.strip()\n    return out\n\n\ndef parse_timeline(path: Path) -> list[dict]:\n30→    text = path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n    frames: list[tuple[int, str]] = [(m.start(), m.group(1)) for m in FRAME_RE.finditer(text)]\n    frames.append((len(text), \"_end\"))\n\n    def frame_at(pos: int) -> str:\n        cur = \"file\"\n        for start, name in frames:\n            if start <= pos:\n                cur = name\n            else:\n40→                break\n        return cur\n\n    rows = []\n    for m in DEFINE_RE.finditer(text):\n        fields = parse_fields(m.group(2))\n        rows.append(\n            {\n                \"id\": m.group(1),\n                \"power\": fields.get(\"power\", \"\"),\n50→                \"hitType\": fields.get(\"hitType\", \"\"),\n                \"hitx\": fields.get(\"hitx\", \"\"),\n                \"hity\": fields.get(\"hity\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtTime\": fields.get(\"hurtTime\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtType\": fields.get(\"hurtType\", \"\"),\n                \"isBreakDef\": fields.get(\"isBreakDef\", \"\"),\n                \"frame\": frame_at(m.start()),\n            }\n        )\n    return rows\n60→\n\ndef load_xml_fighters() -> tuple[list[dict], list[dict]]:\n    playable = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n70→        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        sf = file_el.get(\"startFrame\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        playable.append(\n            {\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url, \"startFrame\": sf}\n        )\n\n    assists = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/assist.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n80→        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        assists.append({\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url})\n    return playable, assists\n\n\ndef url_to_folder(url: str, assist: bool = False) -> str | None:\n    if not url:\n90→        return None\n    # assets/fighter/ichigo.swf -> ichigo\n    # assets/fighter/fz/kon.swf -> fz/kon\n    p = url.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\")\n    if p.startswith(\"assets/fighter/\"):\n        p = p[len(\"assets/fighter/\") :]\n    if p.endswith(\".swf\"):\n        p = p[: -len(\".swf\")]\n    return p\n\n100→\ndef md_escape(s: str) -> str:\n    return s.replace(\"|\", \"\\\\|\")\n\n\ndef write_move_table(lines: list[str], rows: list[dict], by_frame: bool) -> None:\n    if not rows:\n        lines.append(\"_no defineAction found_\")\n        lines.append(\"\")\n        return\n110→    grouped: dict[str, list[dict]] = defaultdict(list)\n    for r in rows:\n        grouped[r[\"frame\"]].append(r)\n    order = list(dict.fromkeys(r[\"frame\"] for r in rows))\n    for fr in order:\n        chunk = grouped[fr]\n        if by_frame:\n            lines.append(f\"**{fr}** ({len(chunk)} moves)\")\n        lines.append(\"| id | power | hitType | hitx | hity | hurtTime | hurtType | isBreakDef |\")\n        lines.append(\"|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\")\n120→        for r in chunk:\n            lines.append(\n                \"| {id} | {power} | {hitType} | {hitx} | {hity} | {hurtTime} | {hurtType} | {isBreakDef} |\".format(\n                    **{k: md_escape(str(r[k])) for k in (\n                        \"id\", \"power\", \"hitType\", \"hitx\", \"hity\", \"hurtTime\", \"hurtType\", \"isBreakDef\"\n                    )}\n                )\n            )\n        lines.append(\"\")\n\n130→\ndef main() -> None:\n    playable_xml, assist_xml = load_xml_fighters()\n\n    timelines = sorted(FIGHTERS.rglob(\"MainTimeline.as\"))\n    by_folder: dict[str, Path] = {}\n    for p in timelines:\n        rel = p.relative_to(FIGHTERS).as_posix()\n        # ichigo/scripts/ichigo_fla/MainTimeline.as -> ichigo\n        folder = rel.split(\"/scripts/\")[0]\n140→        by_folder[folder] = p\n\n    lines: list[str] = []\n    lines.append(\"# 05 角色招式全表\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"从 `decompiled/fighters/**/MainTimeline.as` 抽出全部 `defineAction(id, {…})`。\")\n    lines.append(\"对照 `extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml` 与 `assist.xml`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"引擎：`FighterMain.initlize()` 执行 `_mainMc.gotoAndStop(data.startFrame + 1)`，\")\n    lines.append(\"因此 XML `startFrame=N` 对应时间轴 `frame{N+1}`。\")\n150→    lines.append(\"VO 字段：`power` / `hitType` / `hitx` / `hity` / `hurtTime` / `hurtType` / `isBreakDef`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n\n    # directory table\n    lines.append(\"## 目录\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"| 目录 | 类型 | XML id | 名称 | startFrame | 招式数 |\")\n    lines.append(\"|---|---|---|---|---|---:|\")\n\n    parsed: dict[str, list[dict]] = {}\n160→    for folder, path in sorted(by_folder.items()):","content_concise":"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract defineAction tables from fighter MainTimeline.as into markdown.\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport re\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\n10→ROOT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3\")\nFIGHTERS = ROOT / \"decompiled/fighters\"\nOUT = ROOT / \"reverse/05-fighter-actions.md\"\n\nDEFINE_RE = re.compile(\n    r'defineAction\\(\\s*\"([^\"]+)\"\\s*,\\s*\\{([^}]*)\\}',\n    re.S,\n)\nFRAME_RE = re.compile(r\"internal function (frame\\d+)\\s*\\(\")\nFIELD_RE = re.compile(r'\"(\\w+)\"\\s*:\\s*([^,\\n]+)')\n20→\n\ndef parse_fields(body: str) -> dict[str, str]:\n    out: dict[str, str] = {}\n    for k, v in FIELD_RE.findall(body):\n        out[k] = v.strip()\n    return out\n\n\ndef parse_timeline(path: Path) -> list[dict]:\n30→    text = path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n    frames: list[tuple[int, str]] = [(m.start(), m.group(1)) for m in FRAME_RE.finditer(text)]\n    frames.append((len(text), \"_end\"))\n\n    def frame_at(pos: int) -> str:\n        cur = \"file\"\n        for start, name in frames:\n            if start <= pos:\n                cur = name\n            else:\n40→                break\n        return cur\n\n    rows = []\n    for m in DEFINE_RE.finditer(text):\n        fields = parse_fields(m.group(2))\n        rows.append(\n            {\n                \"id\": m.group(1),\n                \"power\": fields.get(\"power\", \"\"),\n50→                \"hitType\": fields.get(\"hitType\", \"\"),\n                \"hitx\": fields.get(\"hitx\", \"\"),\n                \"hity\": fields.get(\"hity\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtTime\": fields.get(\"hurtTime\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtType\": fields.get(\"hurtType\", \"\"),\n                \"isBreakDef\": fields.get(\"isBreakDef\", \"\"),\n                \"frame\": frame_at(m.start()),\n            }\n        )\n    return rows\n60→\n\ndef load_xml_fighters() -> tuple[list[dict], list[dict]]:\n    playable = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n70→        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        sf = file_el.get(\"startFrame\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        playable.append(\n            {\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url, \"startFrame\": sf}\n        )\n\n    assists = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/assist.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n80→        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        assists.append({\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url})\n    return playable, assists\n\n\ndef url_to_folder(url: str, assist: bool = False) -> str | None:\n    if not url:\n90→        return None\n    # assets/fighter/ichigo.swf -> ichigo\n    # assets/fighter/fz/kon.swf -> fz/kon\n    p = url.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\")\n    if p.startswith(\"assets/fighter/\"):\n        p = p[len(\"assets/fighter/\") :]\n    if p.endswith(\".swf\"):\n        p = p[: -len(\".swf\")]\n    return p\n\n100→\ndef md_escape(s: str) -> str:\n    return s.replace(\"|\", \"\\\\|\")\n\n\ndef write_move_table(lines: list[str], rows: list[dict], by_frame: bool) -> None:\n    if not rows:\n        lines.append(\"_no defineAction found_\")\n        lines.append(\"\")\n        return\n110→    grouped: dict[str, list[dict]] = defaultdict(list)\n    for r in rows:\n        grouped[r[\"frame\"]].append(r)\n    order = list(dict.fromkeys(r[\"frame\"] for r in rows))\n    for fr in order:\n        chunk = grouped[fr]\n        if by_frame:\n            lines.append(f\"**{fr}** ({len(chunk)} moves)\")\n        lines.append(\"| id | power | hitType | hitx | hity | hurtTime | hurtType | isBreakDef |\")\n        lines.append(\"|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\")\n120→        for r in chunk:\n            lines.append(\n                \"| {id} | {power} | {hitType} | {hitx} | {hity} | {hurtTime} | {hurtType} | {isBreakDef} |\".format(\n                    **{k: md_escape(str(r[k])) for k in (\n                        \"id\", \"power\", \"hitType\", \"hitx\", \"hity\", \"hurtTime\", \"hurtType\", \"isBreakDef\"\n                    )}\n                )\n            )\n        lines.append(\"\")\n\n130→\ndef main() -> None:\n    playable_xml, assist_xml = load_xml_fighters()\n\n    timelines = sorted(FIGHTERS.rglob(\"MainTimeline.as\"))\n    by_folder: dict[str, Path] = {}\n    for p in timelines:\n        rel = p.relative_to(FIGHTERS).as_posix()\n        # ichigo/scripts/ichigo_fla/MainTimeline.as -> ichigo\n        folder = rel.split(\"/scripts/\")[0]\n140→        by_folder[folder] = p\n\n    lines: list[str] = []\n    lines.append(\"# 05 角色招式全表\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"从 `decompiled/fighters/**/MainTimeline.as` 抽出全部 `defineAction(id, {…})`。\")\n    lines.append(\"对照 `extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml` 与 `assist.xml`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"引擎：`FighterMain.initlize()` 执行 `_mainMc.gotoAndStop(data.startFrame + 1)`，\")\n    lines.append(\"因此 XML `startFrame=N` 对应时间轴 `frame{N+1}`。\")\n150→    lines.append(\"VO 字段：`power` / `hitType` / `hitx` / `hity` / `hurtTime` / `hurtType` / `isBreakDef`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n\n    # directory table\n    lines.append(\"## 目录\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"| 目录 | 类型 | XML id | 名称 | startFrame | 招式数 |\")\n    lines.append(\"|---|---|---|---|---|---:|\")\n\n    parsed: dict[str, list[dict]] = {}\n160→    for folder, path in sorted(by_folder.items()):","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extract_fighter_actions.py","offset":null,"limit":160,"raw_output":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract defineAction tables from fighter MainTimeline.as into markdown.\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport re\nimport xml.etree.ElementTree as ET\nfrom collections import defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nROOT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3\")\nFIGHTERS = ROOT / \"decompiled/fighters\"\nOUT = ROOT / \"reverse/05-fighter-actions.md\"\n\nDEFINE_RE = re.compile(\n    r'defineAction\\(\\s*\"([^\"]+)\"\\s*,\\s*\\{([^}]*)\\}',\n    re.S,\n)\nFRAME_RE = re.compile(r\"internal function (frame\\d+)\\s*\\(\")\nFIELD_RE = re.compile(r'\"(\\w+)\"\\s*:\\s*([^,\\n]+)')\n\n\ndef parse_fields(body: str) -> dict[str, str]:\n    out: dict[str, str] = {}\n    for k, v in FIELD_RE.findall(body):\n        out[k] = v.strip()\n    return out\n\n\ndef parse_timeline(path: Path) -> list[dict]:\n    text = path.read_text(encoding=\"utf-8\", errors=\"replace\")\n    frames: list[tuple[int, str]] = [(m.start(), m.group(1)) for m in FRAME_RE.finditer(text)]\n    frames.append((len(text), \"_end\"))\n\n    def frame_at(pos: int) -> str:\n        cur = \"file\"\n        for start, name in frames:\n            if start <= pos:\n                cur = name\n            else:\n                break\n        return cur\n\n    rows = []\n    for m in DEFINE_RE.finditer(text):\n        fields = parse_fields(m.group(2))\n        rows.append(\n            {\n                \"id\": m.group(1),\n                \"power\": fields.get(\"power\", \"\"),\n                \"hitType\": fields.get(\"hitType\", \"\"),\n                \"hitx\": fields.get(\"hitx\", \"\"),\n                \"hity\": fields.get(\"hity\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtTime\": fields.get(\"hurtTime\", \"\"),\n                \"hurtType\": fields.get(\"hurtType\", \"\"),\n                \"isBreakDef\": fields.get(\"isBreakDef\", \"\"),\n                \"frame\": frame_at(m.start()),\n            }\n        )\n    return rows\n\n\ndef load_xml_fighters() -> tuple[list[dict], list[dict]]:\n    playable = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        sf = file_el.get(\"startFrame\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        playable.append(\n            {\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url, \"startFrame\": sf}\n        )\n\n    assists = []\n    tree = ET.parse(ROOT / \"extracted/assets/config/assist.xml\")\n    for el in tree.getroot().findall(\"fighter\"):\n        fid = el.get(\"id\")\n        name = el.get(\"name\")\n        comic = el.get(\"comic_type\")\n        file_el = el.find(\"file\")\n        url = file_el.get(\"url\") if file_el is not None else \"\"\n        assists.append({\"id\": fid, \"name\": name, \"comic\": comic, \"url\": url})\n    return playable, assists\n\n\ndef url_to_folder(url: str, assist: bool = False) -> str | None:\n    if not url:\n        return None\n    # assets/fighter/ichigo.swf -> ichigo\n    # assets/fighter/fz/kon.swf -> fz/kon\n    p = url.replace(\"\\\\\", \"/\")\n    if p.startswith(\"assets/fighter/\"):\n        p = p[len(\"assets/fighter/\") :]\n    if p.endswith(\".swf\"):\n        p = p[: -len(\".swf\")]\n    return p\n\n\ndef md_escape(s: str) -> str:\n    return s.replace(\"|\", \"\\\\|\")\n\n\ndef write_move_table(lines: list[str], rows: list[dict], by_frame: bool) -> None:\n    if not rows:\n        lines.append(\"_no defineAction found_\")\n        lines.append(\"\")\n        return\n    grouped: dict[str, list[dict]] = defaultdict(list)\n    for r in rows:\n        grouped[r[\"frame\"]].append(r)\n    order = list(dict.fromkeys(r[\"frame\"] for r in rows))\n    for fr in order:\n        chunk = grouped[fr]\n        if by_frame:\n            lines.append(f\"**{fr}** ({len(chunk)} moves)\")\n        lines.append(\"| id | power | hitType | hitx | hity | hurtTime | hurtType | isBreakDef |\")\n        lines.append(\"|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|\")\n        for r in chunk:\n            lines.append(\n                \"| {id} | {power} | {hitType} | {hitx} | {hity} | {hurtTime} | {hurtType} | {isBreakDef} |\".format(\n                    **{k: md_escape(str(r[k])) for k in (\n                        \"id\", \"power\", \"hitType\", \"hitx\", \"hity\", \"hurtTime\", \"hurtType\", \"isBreakDef\"\n                    )}\n                )\n            )\n        lines.append(\"\")\n\n\ndef main() -> None:\n    playable_xml, assist_xml = load_xml_fighters()\n\n    timelines = sorted(FIGHTERS.rglob(\"MainTimeline.as\"))\n    by_folder: dict[str, Path] = {}\n    for p in timelines:\n        rel = p.relative_to(FIGHTERS).as_posix()\n        # ichigo/scripts/ichigo_fla/MainTimeline.as -> ichigo\n        folder = rel.split(\"/scripts/\")[0]\n        by_folder[folder] = p\n\n    lines: list[str] = []\n    lines.append(\"# 05 角色招式全表\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"从 `decompiled/fighters/**/MainTimeline.as` 抽出全部 `defineAction(id, {…})`。\")\n    lines.append(\"对照 `extracted/assets/config/fighter.xml` 与 `assist.xml`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"引擎：`FighterMain.initlize()` 执行 `_mainMc.gotoAndStop(data.startFrame + 1)`，\")\n    lines.append(\"因此 XML `startFrame=N` 对应时间轴 `frame{N+1}`。\")\n    lines.append(\"VO 字段：`power` / `hitType` / `hitx` / `hity` / `hurtTime` / `hurtType` / `isBreakDef`。\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n\n    # directory table\n    lines.append(\"## 目录\")\n    lines.append(\"\")\n    lines.append(\"| 目录 | 类型 | XML id | 名称 | startFrame | 招式数 |\")\n    lines.append(\"|---|---|---|---|---|---:|\")\n\n    parsed: dict[str, list[dict]] = {}\n    for folder, path in sorted(by_folder.items()):\n","total_lines":293}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-eef44b8e-9b2b-49a8-9b5c-77d81c785797-25","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract everything from BVN 3.3 main.swf (streaming SWF tag parser + zip/nested).\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport io\nimport os\nimport re\nimport sys\nimport zlib\n10→import json\nimport struct\nimport mmap\nimport hashlib\nimport zipfile\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSRC = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/main.swf\")\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extracted/full\")\n20→INV_COPY = Path(\"/home/box/Downloads/bvn-3.3-extracted-inventory.txt\")\n\nTAG_NAMES = {\n    0: \"End\", 1: \"ShowFrame\", 2: \"DefineShape\", 4: \"PlaceObject\", 5: \"RemoveObject\",\n    6: \"DefineBits\", 7: \"DefineButton\", 8: \"JPEGTables\", 9: \"SetBackgroundColor\",\n    10: \"DefineFont\", 11: \"DefineText\", 12: \"DoAction\", 13: \"DefineFontInfo\",\n    14: \"DefineSound\", 15: \"StartSound\", 17: \"DefineButtonSound\", 18: \"SoundStreamHead\",\n    19: \"SoundStreamBlock\", 20: \"DefineBitsLossless\", 21: \"DefineBitsJPEG2\",\n    22: \"DefineShape2\", 23: \"DefineButtonCxform\", 24: \"Protect\", 26: \"PlaceObject2\",\n    28: \"RemoveObject2\", 32: \"DefineShape3\", 33: \"DefineText2\", 34: \"DefineButton2\",\n30→    35: \"DefineBitsJPEG3\", 36: \"DefineBitsLossless2\", 37: \"DefineEditText\",\n    39: \"DefineSprite\", 41: \"ProductInfo\", 43: \"FrameLabel\", 45: \"SoundStreamHead2\",\n    46: \"DefineMorphShape\", 48: \"DefineFont2\", 56: \"ExportAssets\", 57: \"ImportAssets\",\n    58: \"EnableDebugger\", 59: \"DoInitAction\", 60: \"DefineVideoStream\", 61: \"VideoFrame\",\n    62: \"DefineFontInfo2\", 64: \"EnableDebugger2\", 65: \"ScriptLimits\", 66: \"SetTabIndex\",\n    69: \"FileAttributes\", 70: \"PlaceObject3\", 71: \"ImportAssets2\", 72: \"DoABCLegacy\",\n    73: \"DefineFontAlignZones\", 74: \"CSMTextSettings\", 75: \"DefineFont3\", 76: \"SymbolClass\",\n    77: \"Metadata\", 78: \"DefineScalingGrid\", 82: \"DoABC\", 83: \"DefineShape4\",\n    84: \"DefineMorphShape2\", 86: \"DefineSceneAndFrameLabelData\", 87: \"DefineBinaryData\",\n    88: \"DefineFontName\", 89: \"StartSound2\", 90: \"DefineBitsJPEG4\", 91: \"DefineFont4\",\n40→    93: \"EnableTelemetry\",\n}\n\nCHAR_ID_TAGS = {\n    2, 6, 7, 10, 11, 13, 14, 17, 20, 21, 22, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 39, 46, 48,\n    60, 73, 75, 83, 84, 87, 88, 90, 91,\n}\n\nSOUND_RATES = {0: 5512, 1: 11025, 2: 22050, 3: 44100}\nSOUND_FMT = {\n50→    0: \"pcm_native\", 1: \"adpcm\", 2: \"mp3\", 3: \"pcm_le\", 4: \"nelly_16k\",\n    5: \"nelly_8k\", 6: \"nellymoser\", 11: \"speex\",\n}\n\nRAW_TAG_MAX = 512 * 1024  # skip giant raw tag dumps if already exported\nNESTED_SWF_FULL_MAX = 2 * 1024 * 1024  # full tag dump for nested SWFs under this size\n\n\ndef ensure_dirs():\n    for d in (\n60→        \"tags\", \"images\", \"sounds\", \"abc\", \"binary-data\", \"zips\", \"xml\",\n        \"nested-swf\", \"swf\", \"strings\",\n    ):\n        (OUT / d).mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n\n\ndef safe_name(s: str, maxlen: int = 80) -> str:\n    s = re.sub(r\"[^\\w.\\-]+\", \"_\", s, flags=re.ASCII)\n    return s[:maxlen] or \"x\"\n\n70→\ndef read_u16(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<H\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef read_u32(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<I\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef cstring(data: bytes, off: int) -> tuple[str, int]:\n80→    end = data.find(b\"\\x00\", off)"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract everything from BVN 3.3 main.swf (streaming SWF tag parser + zip/nested).\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport io\nimport os\nimport re\nimport sys\nimport zlib\n10→import json\nimport struct\nimport mmap\nimport hashlib\nimport zipfile\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSRC = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/main.swf\")\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extracted/full\")\n20→INV_COPY = Path(\"/home/box/Downloads/bvn-3.3-extracted-inventory.txt\")\n\nTAG_NAMES = {\n    0: \"End\", 1: \"ShowFrame\", 2: \"DefineShape\", 4: \"PlaceObject\", 5: \"RemoveObject\",\n    6: \"DefineBits\", 7: \"DefineButton\", 8: \"JPEGTables\", 9: \"SetBackgroundColor\",\n    10: \"DefineFont\", 11: \"DefineText\", 12: \"DoAction\", 13: \"DefineFontInfo\",\n    14: \"DefineSound\", 15: \"StartSound\", 17: \"DefineButtonSound\", 18: \"SoundStreamHead\",\n    19: \"SoundStreamBlock\", 20: \"DefineBitsLossless\", 21: \"DefineBitsJPEG2\",\n    22: \"DefineShape2\", 23: \"DefineButtonCxform\", 24: \"Protect\", 26: \"PlaceObject2\",\n    28: \"RemoveObject2\", 32: \"DefineShape3\", 33: \"DefineText2\", 34: \"DefineButton2\",\n30→    35: \"DefineBitsJPEG3\", 36: \"DefineBitsLossless2\", 37: \"DefineEditText\",\n    39: \"DefineSprite\", 41: \"ProductInfo\", 43: \"FrameLabel\", 45: \"SoundStreamHead2\",\n    46: \"DefineMorphShape\", 48: \"DefineFont2\", 56: \"ExportAssets\", 57: \"ImportAssets\",\n    58: \"EnableDebugger\", 59: \"DoInitAction\", 60: \"DefineVideoStream\", 61: \"VideoFrame\",\n    62: \"DefineFontInfo2\", 64: \"EnableDebugger2\", 65: \"ScriptLimits\", 66: \"SetTabIndex\",\n    69: \"FileAttributes\", 70: \"PlaceObject3\", 71: \"ImportAssets2\", 72: \"DoABCLegacy\",\n    73: \"DefineFontAlignZones\", 74: \"CSMTextSettings\", 75: \"DefineFont3\", 76: \"SymbolClass\",\n    77: \"Metadata\", 78: \"DefineScalingGrid\", 82: \"DoABC\", 83: \"DefineShape4\",\n    84: \"DefineMorphShape2\", 86: \"DefineSceneAndFrameLabelData\", 87: \"DefineBinaryData\",\n    88: \"DefineFontName\", 89: \"StartSound2\", 90: \"DefineBitsJPEG4\", 91: \"DefineFont4\",\n40→    93: \"EnableTelemetry\",\n}\n\nCHAR_ID_TAGS = {\n    2, 6, 7, 10, 11, 13, 14, 17, 20, 21, 22, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 39, 46, 48,\n    60, 73, 75, 83, 84, 87, 88, 90, 91,\n}\n\nSOUND_RATES = {0: 5512, 1: 11025, 2: 22050, 3: 44100}\nSOUND_FMT = {\n50→    0: \"pcm_native\", 1: \"adpcm\", 2: \"mp3\", 3: \"pcm_le\", 4: \"nelly_16k\",\n    5: \"nelly_8k\", 6: \"nellymoser\", 11: \"speex\",\n}\n\nRAW_TAG_MAX = 512 * 1024  # skip giant raw tag dumps if already exported\nNESTED_SWF_FULL_MAX = 2 * 1024 * 1024  # full tag dump for nested SWFs under this size\n\n\ndef ensure_dirs():\n    for d in (\n60→        \"tags\", \"images\", \"sounds\", \"abc\", \"binary-data\", \"zips\", \"xml\",\n        \"nested-swf\", \"swf\", \"strings\",\n    ):\n        (OUT / d).mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n\n\ndef safe_name(s: str, maxlen: int = 80) -> str:\n    s = re.sub(r\"[^\\w.\\-]+\", \"_\", s, flags=re.ASCII)\n    return s[:maxlen] or \"x\"\n\n70→\ndef read_u16(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<H\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef read_u32(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<I\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef cstring(data: bytes, off: int) -> tuple[str, int]:\n80→    end = data.find(b\"\\x00\", off)","content_concise":"1→#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract everything from BVN 3.3 main.swf (streaming SWF tag parser + zip/nested).\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport io\nimport os\nimport re\nimport sys\nimport zlib\n10→import json\nimport struct\nimport mmap\nimport hashlib\nimport zipfile\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSRC = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/main.swf\")\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extracted/full\")\n20→INV_COPY = Path(\"/home/box/Downloads/bvn-3.3-extracted-inventory.txt\")\n\nTAG_NAMES = {\n    0: \"End\", 1: \"ShowFrame\", 2: \"DefineShape\", 4: \"PlaceObject\", 5: \"RemoveObject\",\n    6: \"DefineBits\", 7: \"DefineButton\", 8: \"JPEGTables\", 9: \"SetBackgroundColor\",\n    10: \"DefineFont\", 11: \"DefineText\", 12: \"DoAction\", 13: \"DefineFontInfo\",\n    14: \"DefineSound\", 15: \"StartSound\", 17: \"DefineButtonSound\", 18: \"SoundStreamHead\",\n    19: \"SoundStreamBlock\", 20: \"DefineBitsLossless\", 21: \"DefineBitsJPEG2\",\n    22: \"DefineShape2\", 23: \"DefineButtonCxform\", 24: \"Protect\", 26: \"PlaceObject2\",\n    28: \"RemoveObject2\", 32: \"DefineShape3\", 33: \"DefineText2\", 34: \"DefineButton2\",\n30→    35: \"DefineBitsJPEG3\", 36: \"DefineBitsLossless2\", 37: \"DefineEditText\",\n    39: \"DefineSprite\", 41: \"ProductInfo\", 43: \"FrameLabel\", 45: \"SoundStreamHead2\",\n    46: \"DefineMorphShape\", 48: \"DefineFont2\", 56: \"ExportAssets\", 57: \"ImportAssets\",\n    58: \"EnableDebugger\", 59: \"DoInitAction\", 60: \"DefineVideoStream\", 61: \"VideoFrame\",\n    62: \"DefineFontInfo2\", 64: \"EnableDebugger2\", 65: \"ScriptLimits\", 66: \"SetTabIndex\",\n    69: \"FileAttributes\", 70: \"PlaceObject3\", 71: \"ImportAssets2\", 72: \"DoABCLegacy\",\n    73: \"DefineFontAlignZones\", 74: \"CSMTextSettings\", 75: \"DefineFont3\", 76: \"SymbolClass\",\n    77: \"Metadata\", 78: \"DefineScalingGrid\", 82: \"DoABC\", 83: \"DefineShape4\",\n    84: \"DefineMorphShape2\", 86: \"DefineSceneAndFrameLabelData\", 87: \"DefineBinaryData\",\n    88: \"DefineFontName\", 89: \"StartSound2\", 90: \"DefineBitsJPEG4\", 91: \"DefineFont4\",\n40→    93: \"EnableTelemetry\",\n}\n\nCHAR_ID_TAGS = {\n    2, 6, 7, 10, 11, 13, 14, 17, 20, 21, 22, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 39, 46, 48,\n    60, 73, 75, 83, 84, 87, 88, 90, 91,\n}\n\nSOUND_RATES = {0: 5512, 1: 11025, 2: 22050, 3: 44100}\nSOUND_FMT = {\n50→    0: \"pcm_native\", 1: \"adpcm\", 2: \"mp3\", 3: \"pcm_le\", 4: \"nelly_16k\",\n    5: \"nelly_8k\", 6: \"nellymoser\", 11: \"speex\",\n}\n\nRAW_TAG_MAX = 512 * 1024  # skip giant raw tag dumps if already exported\nNESTED_SWF_FULL_MAX = 2 * 1024 * 1024  # full tag dump for nested SWFs under this size\n\n\ndef ensure_dirs():\n    for d in (\n60→        \"tags\", \"images\", \"sounds\", \"abc\", \"binary-data\", \"zips\", \"xml\",\n        \"nested-swf\", \"swf\", \"strings\",\n    ):\n        (OUT / d).mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n\n\ndef safe_name(s: str, maxlen: int = 80) -> str:\n    s = re.sub(r\"[^\\w.\\-]+\", \"_\", s, flags=re.ASCII)\n    return s[:maxlen] or \"x\"\n\n70→\ndef read_u16(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<H\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef read_u32(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<I\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef cstring(data: bytes, off: int) -> tuple[str, int]:\n80→    end = data.find(b\"\\x00\", off)","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extract_full.py","offset":null,"limit":80,"raw_output":"#!/usr/bin/env python3\n\"\"\"Extract everything from BVN 3.3 main.swf (streaming SWF tag parser + zip/nested).\"\"\"\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport io\nimport os\nimport re\nimport sys\nimport zlib\nimport json\nimport struct\nimport mmap\nimport hashlib\nimport zipfile\nfrom collections import Counter, defaultdict\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nSRC = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/main.swf\")\nOUT = Path(\"/workspace/bvn-3.3/extracted/full\")\nINV_COPY = Path(\"/home/box/Downloads/bvn-3.3-extracted-inventory.txt\")\n\nTAG_NAMES = {\n    0: \"End\", 1: \"ShowFrame\", 2: \"DefineShape\", 4: \"PlaceObject\", 5: \"RemoveObject\",\n    6: \"DefineBits\", 7: \"DefineButton\", 8: \"JPEGTables\", 9: \"SetBackgroundColor\",\n    10: \"DefineFont\", 11: \"DefineText\", 12: \"DoAction\", 13: \"DefineFontInfo\",\n    14: \"DefineSound\", 15: \"StartSound\", 17: \"DefineButtonSound\", 18: \"SoundStreamHead\",\n    19: \"SoundStreamBlock\", 20: \"DefineBitsLossless\", 21: \"DefineBitsJPEG2\",\n    22: \"DefineShape2\", 23: \"DefineButtonCxform\", 24: \"Protect\", 26: \"PlaceObject2\",\n    28: \"RemoveObject2\", 32: \"DefineShape3\", 33: \"DefineText2\", 34: \"DefineButton2\",\n    35: \"DefineBitsJPEG3\", 36: \"DefineBitsLossless2\", 37: \"DefineEditText\",\n    39: \"DefineSprite\", 41: \"ProductInfo\", 43: \"FrameLabel\", 45: \"SoundStreamHead2\",\n    46: \"DefineMorphShape\", 48: \"DefineFont2\", 56: \"ExportAssets\", 57: \"ImportAssets\",\n    58: \"EnableDebugger\", 59: \"DoInitAction\", 60: \"DefineVideoStream\", 61: \"VideoFrame\",\n    62: \"DefineFontInfo2\", 64: \"EnableDebugger2\", 65: \"ScriptLimits\", 66: \"SetTabIndex\",\n    69: \"FileAttributes\", 70: \"PlaceObject3\", 71: \"ImportAssets2\", 72: \"DoABCLegacy\",\n    73: \"DefineFontAlignZones\", 74: \"CSMTextSettings\", 75: \"DefineFont3\", 76: \"SymbolClass\",\n    77: \"Metadata\", 78: \"DefineScalingGrid\", 82: \"DoABC\", 83: \"DefineShape4\",\n    84: \"DefineMorphShape2\", 86: \"DefineSceneAndFrameLabelData\", 87: \"DefineBinaryData\",\n    88: \"DefineFontName\", 89: \"StartSound2\", 90: \"DefineBitsJPEG4\", 91: \"DefineFont4\",\n    93: \"EnableTelemetry\",\n}\n\nCHAR_ID_TAGS = {\n    2, 6, 7, 10, 11, 13, 14, 17, 20, 21, 22, 32, 33, 34, 35, 36, 37, 39, 46, 48,\n    60, 73, 75, 83, 84, 87, 88, 90, 91,\n}\n\nSOUND_RATES = {0: 5512, 1: 11025, 2: 22050, 3: 44100}\nSOUND_FMT = {\n    0: \"pcm_native\", 1: \"adpcm\", 2: \"mp3\", 3: \"pcm_le\", 4: \"nelly_16k\",\n    5: \"nelly_8k\", 6: \"nellymoser\", 11: \"speex\",\n}\n\nRAW_TAG_MAX = 512 * 1024  # skip giant raw tag dumps if already exported\nNESTED_SWF_FULL_MAX = 2 * 1024 * 1024  # full tag dump for nested SWFs under this size\n\n\ndef ensure_dirs():\n    for d in (\n        \"tags\", \"images\", \"sounds\", \"abc\", \"binary-data\", \"zips\", \"xml\",\n        \"nested-swf\", \"swf\", \"strings\",\n    ):\n        (OUT / d).mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n\n\ndef safe_name(s: str, maxlen: int = 80) -> str:\n    s = re.sub(r\"[^\\w.\\-]+\", \"_\", s, flags=re.ASCII)\n    return s[:maxlen] or \"x\"\n\n\ndef read_u16(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<H\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef read_u32(data: bytes, off: int) -> int:\n    return struct.unpack_from(\"<I\", data, off)[0]\n\n\ndef cstring(data: bytes, off: int) -> tuple[str, int]:\n    end = data.find(b\"\\x00\", off)\n","total_lines":1204}},"locations":[]}
{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-eef44b8e-9b2b-49a8-9b5c-77d81c785797-29","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"1→# `sasuke_xz_fla.须作_砍技2效果_9` — 攻击体 `须作_砍技2效果_9`\n\n一句话目的：攻击体/技能 clip `须作_砍技2效果_9`：`setAttackerCtrler` 注入 `$attacker_ctrler`，帧脚本驱动位移/命中/自毁。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/sasuke_xz/scripts/sasuke_xz_fla/须作_砍技2效果_9.as`（42 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n攻击体 clip。动作 MC 里 `addAttacker(...)` 之后引擎调 `setAttackerCtrler` 注入 [`FighterAttacker`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterAttacker.md) 门面 `$attacker_ctrler`（没有也不 throw）。`FighterMC.renderChildren` 对名字含 `atm` 的子件不自动 `nextFrame`；本类若被当独立 attacker 播，则走自己的帧脚本。\n10→\nEmbed `source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol166\"`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n### 字段\n\n| L | 名字 | 类型 |\n|---|---|---|\n| L22 | `k5atm` | `MovieClip` | 攻击判定盒（displayName → HitVO）\n20→| L24 | `$attacker_ctrler` | `*` | 攻击体控制器\n\n### 函数\n\n#### `须作_砍技2效果_9()`（L26–30）\n\n- L28: `super();`\n- L29: `addFrameScript(0, frame1);`\n\n#### `setAttackerCtrler(param1:*)`（L32–35）\n30→\n- L34: `$attacker_ctrler = param1;`\n\n### 逐帧脚本\n\n共 1 个 `addFrameScript` 点。帧标签不在 AS 中，按帧号分段。每个脚本帧都列出，不跳过。\n\n#### F1 — 空帧\n\n| 帧 | 函数 L | 调用 |\n40→|---|---|---|\n| F1 | L37–39 / L37 | （空） |\n"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"1→# `sasuke_xz_fla.须作_砍技2效果_9` — 攻击体 `须作_砍技2效果_9`\n\n一句话目的：攻击体/技能 clip `须作_砍技2效果_9`：`setAttackerCtrler` 注入 `$attacker_ctrler`，帧脚本驱动位移/命中/自毁。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/sasuke_xz/scripts/sasuke_xz_fla/须作_砍技2效果_9.as`（42 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n攻击体 clip。动作 MC 里 `addAttacker(...)` 之后引擎调 `setAttackerCtrler` 注入 [`FighterAttacker`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterAttacker.md) 门面 `$attacker_ctrler`（没有也不 throw）。`FighterMC.renderChildren` 对名字含 `atm` 的子件不自动 `nextFrame`；本类若被当独立 attacker 播，则走自己的帧脚本。\n10→\nEmbed `source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol166\"`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n### 字段\n\n| L | 名字 | 类型 |\n|---|---|---|\n| L22 | `k5atm` | `MovieClip` | 攻击判定盒（displayName → HitVO）\n20→| L24 | `$attacker_ctrler` | `*` | 攻击体控制器\n\n### 函数\n\n#### `须作_砍技2效果_9()`（L26–30）\n\n- L28: `super();`\n- L29: `addFrameScript(0, frame1);`\n\n#### `setAttackerCtrler(param1:*)`（L32–35）\n30→\n- L34: `$attacker_ctrler = param1;`\n\n### 逐帧脚本\n\n共 1 个 `addFrameScript` 点。帧标签不在 AS 中，按帧号分段。每个脚本帧都列出，不跳过。\n\n#### F1 — 空帧\n\n| 帧 | 函数 L | 调用 |\n40→|---|---|---|\n| F1 | L37–39 / L37 | （空） |\n","content_concise":"1→# `sasuke_xz_fla.须作_砍技2效果_9` — 攻击体 `须作_砍技2效果_9`\n\n一句话目的：攻击体/技能 clip `须作_砍技2效果_9`：`setAttackerCtrler` 注入 `$attacker_ctrler`，帧脚本驱动位移/命中/自毁。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/sasuke_xz/scripts/sasuke_xz_fla/须作_砍技2效果_9.as`（42 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n攻击体 clip。动作 MC 里 `addAttacker(...)` 之后引擎调 `setAttackerCtrler` 注入 [`FighterAttacker`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterAttacker.md) 门面 `$attacker_ctrler`（没有也不 throw）。`FighterMC.renderChildren` 对名字含 `atm` 的子件不自动 `nextFrame`；本类若被当独立 attacker 播，则走自己的帧脚本。\n10→\nEmbed `source=\"/_assets/assets.swf\", symbol=\"symbol166\"`。\n\n## 逐行说明\n\n### 字段\n\n| L | 名字 | 类型 |\n|---|---|---|\n| L22 | `k5atm` | `MovieClip` | 攻击判定盒（displayName → HitVO）\n20→| L24 | `$attacker_ctrler` | `*` | 攻击体控制器\n\n### 函数\n\n#### `须作_砍技2效果_9()`（L26–30）\n\n- L28: `super();`\n- L29: `addFrameScript(0, frame1);`\n\n#### `setAttackerCtrler(param1:*)`（L32–35）\n30→\n- L34: `$attacker_ctrler = param1;`\n\n### 逐帧脚本\n\n共 1 个 `addFrameScript` 点。帧标签不在 AS 中，按帧号分段。每个脚本帧都列出，不跳过。\n\n#### F1 — 空帧\n\n| 帧 | 函数 L | 调用 |\n40→|---|---|---|\n| F1 | L37–39 / L37 | （空） |\n","absolute_path":"/workspace/bvn-3.3/reverse/line-by-line/fighters/sasuke_xz/scripts/sasuke_xz_fla/须作_砍技2效果_9.md","offset":null,"raw_output":"# `sasuke_xz_fla.须作_砍技2效果_9` — 攻击体 `须作_砍技2效果_9`\n\n一句话目的：攻击体/技能 clip `须作_砍技2效果_9`：`setAttackerCtrler` 注入 `$attacker_ctrler`，帧脚本驱动位移/命中/自毁。\n\n源文件：`decompiled/fighters/sasuke_xz/scripts/sasuke_xz_fla/须作_砍技2效果_9.as`（42 行）\n\n## 如何挂上引擎\n\n攻击体 clip。动作 MC 里 `addAttacker(...)` 之后引擎调 `setAttackerCtrler` 注入 [`FighterAttacker`](../../../../engine/game/bvn/fighter/FighterAttacker.md) 门面 `$attacker_