{"type":"tool_call_update","toolCallId":"call-54f08ba4-ad7f-4e9d-ab10-5d3fdbb3ad62-63","status":"completed","content":[{"type":"content","content":{"type":"text","text":"50→| L76 | `zh3atm` | `MovieClip` | 攻击判定盒（displayName → HitVO）\n| L78 | `fmc` | `*` | 攻击体 MC（`addAttacker` 名）\n\n### 函数\n\n#### `碎蜂全动作_1()`（L80–85）\n\n- L82: `super();`\n- L83: `addFrameScript(12, frame13, 15, frame16, 19, frame20, 23, frame24, 25, frame26, 34, frame35, 41, frame42, 43, frame44, 81, frame82, 155, frame156, 175, frame176, 248, frame249, 289, frame290, 317, frame318, 327, frame328, 329, frame330, 334, frame335, 339, frame340, 341, frame342, 343, frame344, 344, frame345, 347, frame348, 358, frame359, 359, frame360, 369, frame370, 375, frame376, 378, frame379, 382, frame383, 386, frame387, 398, frame399, 407, frame408, 412, frame413, 418, frame419, 421, frame422, 429, frame430, 435, frame436, 440, frame441, 447, frame448, 460, frame461, 473, frame474, 483, frame484, 486, frame487, 497, frame498, 503, frame504, 519, frame520, 526, frame527, 537, frame538, 547, frame548, 559, frame560, 606, frame607, 610, frame611, 620, frame621, 623, frame624, 632, frame633, 652, frame653, 653, frame654, 662, frame663, 679, frame680, 684, frame685, 689, frame690, 717, frame718, 718, frame719, 724, frame725, 732, frame733, 737, frame738, 738, frame739, 742, frame743, 752, frame753, 773, frame774, 785, frame786, 795, frame796, 816, frame817, 834, frame835, 872, frame873, 878, frame879, 881, frame882, 882, frame883, 887, frame888, 894, frame895, 907, frame908, 919, frame920, 920, frame921, 933, frame934, 936, frame937, 938, frame939, 960, frame961, 973, frame974, 975, frame976, 1010, frame1011, 1017, frame1018, 1022, frame1023, 1029, frame1030, 1036, frame1037, 1045, frame1046, 1120, frame1121, 1127, frame1128, 1159, frame1160, 1182, frame1183, 1217, frame1218, 1249, frame1250, 1260, frame1261, 1325, frame1326);`\n\n60→### 逐帧脚本\n\n共 102 个 `addFrameScript` 点。帧标签不在 AS 中，按帧号分段。每个脚本帧都列出，不跳过。\n\n#### F13–F44 — 动作 `走` / `砍2`\n\n| 帧 | 函数 L | 调用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| F13 | L87–90 / L89 | `$effect_ctrler.walk();` — 走路尘土 |\n| F16 | L92–95 / L94 | `$effect_ctrler.walk();` — 走路尘土 |\n70→| F20 | L97–100 / L99 | `$effect_ctrler.walk();` — 走路尘土 |\n| F24 | L102–105 / L104 | `$effect_ctrler.walk();` — 走路尘土 |\n| F26 | L107–110 / L109 | `$mc_ctrler.loop(\"走\");` — 走路循环标签 |\n| F35 | L112–119 / L114 | `$mc_ctrler.dash(2.4);` — 冲刺速度倍率 |\n|  |  / L115 | `$mc_ctrler.setAttack(\"砍2\");` — 允许普攻接到指定帧标签 |\n|  |  / L116 | `$mc_ctrler.setBishaUP();` — 允许上必杀 |\n|  |  / L117 | `$effect_ctrler.dash();` — 冲刺特效 dash/dash_air |\n|  |  / L118 | `$effect_ctrler.shadow(0, 0, 0);` — 残影 |\n| F42 | L121–125 / L123 | `$mc_ctrler.dashStop();` — 停冲 |\n|  |  / L124 | `$effect_ctrler.endShadow();` — 关残影 |\n80→| F44 | L127–130 / L129 | `$mc_ctrler.idle();` — 回站立，重填允许表 |\n\n#### F82 — 回站立\n\n| 帧 | 函数 L | 调用 |\n|---|---|---|\n| F82 | L132–135 / L134 | `$mc_ctrler.idle();` — 回站立，重填允许表 |\n\n#### F156 — 回站立\n"}}],"rawOutput":{"type":"ReadFile","FileContent":{"content":"50→| L76 | `zh3atm` | `MovieClip` | 攻击判定盒（displayName → HitVO）\n| L78 | `fmc` | `*` | 攻击体 MC（`addAttacker` 名）\n\n### 函数\n\n#### `碎蜂全动作_1()`（L80–85）\n\n- L82: `super();`\n- L83: `addFrameScript(12, frame13, 15, frame16, 19, frame20, 23, frame24, 25, frame26, 34, frame35, 41, frame42, 43, frame44, 81, frame82, 155, frame156, 175, frame176, 248, frame249, 289, frame290, 317, frame318, 327, frame328, 329, frame330, 334, frame335, 339, frame340, 341, frame342, 343, frame344, 344, frame345, 347, frame348, 358, frame359, 359, frame360, 369, frame370, 375, frame376, 378, frame379, 382, frame383, 386, frame387, 398, frame399, 407, frame408, 412, frame413, 418, frame419, 421, frame422, 429, frame430, 435, frame436, 440, frame441, 447, frame448, 460, frame461, 473, frame474, 483, frame484, 486, frame487, 497, frame498, 503, frame504, 519, frame520, 526, frame527, 537, frame538, 547, frame548, 559, frame560, 606, frame607, 610, frame611, 620, frame621, 623, frame624, 63